
 = Glass Kettle =

 The glass kettle is a household object described for a test . Water inside it can be watched as it boils , and the lid whistles a low note .

 = = Care = =

 It is rinsed with vinegar once a month and kept away from cold window sills .

 = Hollow Hill =

 Hollow Hill is a made-up hill with a cave that runs through it from north to south . Walkers cross it in an hour .

